    LLM: 'Game: Cassino. 52-card fishing game. Capture by pair or sum. Builds must be announced. Big Cassino 10â™¦=2pts, Little Cassino 2â™ =1pt, Aces=1pt each, Most Cards=3pts, Most Spades=1pt, Sweeps=1pt each. Target: 11 points.',
